  "profileSupport_screenText": "How is power calculated",
  "@profileSupport_screenText": {
    "description": "lib/features/profile/support/support_screen.dart:34"
  },
  "profileSupport_screenText10": "A Launch asset that hasn't graduated can only be bought, and only through its own channel. A rejection comes with a specific error code, shown as-is on the trade page.",
  "@profileSupport_screenText10": {
    "description": "lib/features/profile/support/support_screen.dart:58"
  },
  "profileSupport_screenText2": "Power comes from the latest power snapshot: each registered asset's holding times its weight, not its price, listed line by line in the power breakdown. It counts holdings in wallets linked to your LOOP account; a community token counts only when it's bound to an approved community. The Mining page shows that snapshot's block and time.",
  "@profileSupport_screenText2": {
    "description": "lib/features/profile/support/support_screen.dart:35"
  },
  "profileSupport_screenText3": "Why does my token have no weight",
  "@profileSupport_screenText3": {
    "description": "lib/features/profile/support/support_screen.dart:40"
  },
  "profileSupport_screenText4": "Only registered assets count toward mining. Registration follows LOOP's registry, not whether a token has appeared in your wallet. Tokens bound to communities under review have no weight.",
  "@profileSupport_screenText4": {
    "description": "lib/features/profile/support/support_screen.dart:41"
  },
  "profileSupport_screenText5": "How do I join a Launch",
  "@profileSupport_screenText5": {
    "description": "lib/features/profile/support/support_screen.dart:45"
  },
  "profileSupport_screenText6": "Launch rounds, snapshots and limits are set by contract parameters. Until they're confirmed, the Launch page only shows existing round status and promises no allocation.",
  "@profileSupport_screenText6": {
    "description": "lib/features/profile/support/support_screen.dart:46"
  },
  "profileSupport_screenText7": "How do I recover my account on a new phone",
  "@profileSupport_screenText7": {
    "description": "lib/features/profile/support/support_screen.dart:50"
  },
  "profileSupport_screenText8": "Your account identity is held by Privy. Passkeys and multi-factor authentication can be turned on in Security Center, and automatic recovery is the default method; social recovery and private key export aren't open yet. Security Center shows the current status of each.",
  "@profileSupport_screenText8": {
    "description": "lib/features/profile/support/support_screen.dart:52"
  },
  "profileSupport_screenText9": "Why was my bonding pool buy rejected",
  "@profileSupport_screenText9": {
    "description": "lib/features/profile/support/support_screen.dart:57"
  },
