    "description": "lib/features/system/system_surfaces.dart:1465"
  },
  "system_surfacesBody14": "Tap a button to show a real toast. It disappears after 2.6 seconds.",
  "@system_surfacesBody14": {
    "description": "lib/features/system/system_surfaces.dart:1565"
  },
  "system_surfacesBody15": "Normal, identifying and Launch asset share one structure, not one risk judgment. This component appears in chats, community home, market lists and search results, with no route of its own.",
  "@system_surfacesBody15": {
    "description": "lib/features/system/system_surfaces.dart:1716"
  },
  "system_surfacesBody16": "Every item shows its source and time, with no verdict like \"dangerous\" or \"unsafe\". The call is yours.",
  "@system_surfacesBody16": {
    "description": "lib/features/system/system_surfaces.dart:1728"
  },
  "system_surfacesBody17": "Send, Swap, Launch buys and approvals all go through this one sheet; staking joins only after its own contract plan is approved.",
  "@system_surfacesBody17": {
    "description": "lib/features/system/system_surfaces.dart:1766"
  },
  "system_surfacesBody18": "Your wallet stopped it by your own rule, so the copy says which rule and how to change it, not just \"failed\".",
  "@system_surfacesBody18": {
    "description": "lib/features/system/system_surfaces.dart:1814"
  },
  "system_surfacesBody19": "Go back and try again.",
  "@system_surfacesBody19": {
    "description": "lib/features/system/system_surfaces.dart:1839"
  },
  "system_surfacesBody2": "Everything else works. Prices and charts may be off; actions that depend on the current price are paused.",
  "@system_surfacesBody2": {
    "description": "lib/features/system/system_surfaces.dart:863"
  },
  "system_surfacesBody3": "Orders and account changes can't be submitted; market browsing and chat still work.",
  "@system_surfacesBody3": {
    "description": "lib/features/system/system_surfaces.dart:870"
  },
  "system_surfacesBody4": "Other chains are fine. BSC balances may be off, and trading on that chain is paused.",
  "@system_surfacesBody4": {
    "description": "lib/features/system/system_surfaces.dart:931"
  },
  "system_surfacesBody5": "A full outage blocks everything; a single-chain outage should leave other chains working. Blocking it all makes people think the whole app is broken.",
  "@system_surfacesBody5": {
    "description": "lib/features/system/system_surfaces.dart:935, lib/features/system/system_surfaces.dart:994"
  },
  "system_surfacesBody6": "Per-chain status can't be read right now. This page won't decide for you whether a chain is available.",
  "@system_surfacesBody6": {
    "description": "lib/features/system/system_surfaces.dart:982"
  },
  "system_surfacesBody7": "Trace ID 7f3a2c9e. Wallet assets stay on-chain, unaffected.",
  "@system_surfacesBody7": {
    "description": "lib/features/system/system_surfaces.dart:1049"
  },
  "system_surfacesBody8": "{trace}. Don't assume success or failure; check the latest status before retrying. Wallet assets stay on-chain, unaffected.",
  "@system_surfacesBody8": {
    "description": "lib/features/system/system_surfaces.dart:1081",
    "placeholders": {
      "trace": {
        "type": "Object?"
      }
    }
  },
  "system_surfacesBody9": "LOOP only blocks when an approved version policy requires an update and this version is below its floor.",
  "@system_surfacesBody9": {
    "description": "lib/features/system/system_surfaces.dart:1136"
  },
  "system_surfacesCaption": "Everything else still works; affected actions stay disabled until recovery.",
  "@system_surfacesCaption": {
    "description": "lib/features/system/system_surfaces.dart:954"
  },
  "system_surfacesCaption10": "Send, Swap, DApp and Bridge all go through one signing exit.",
  "@system_surfacesCaption10": {
    "description": "lib/features/system/system_surfaces.dart:1758"
  },
  "system_surfacesCaption11": "LOOP doesn't recognize the requested system page.",
  "@system_surfacesCaption11": {
    "description": "lib/features/system/system_surfaces.dart:1836"
  },
  "system_surfacesCaption2": "Opening this page doesn't mean this version is unsupported or unsafe.",
  "@system_surfacesCaption2": {
    "description": "lib/features/system/system_surfaces.dart:1125"
  },
  "system_surfacesCaption3": "An approved version policy requires a supported version. This can't be skipped.",
  "@system_surfacesCaption3": {
    "description": "lib/features/system/system_surfaces.dart:1147"
  },
  "system_surfacesCaption4": "Opening this page doesn't mean your region or account is restricted.",
  "@system_surfacesCaption4": {
    "description": "lib/features/system/system_surfaces.dart:1324"
  },
  "system_surfacesCaption5": "Assets stay visible read-only; restricted features follow each page's current state.",
  "@system_surfacesCaption5": {
    "description": "lib/features/system/system_surfaces.dart:1350"
  },
  "system_surfacesCaption6": "Restricted features follow each page's current state; unconfirmed availability isn't listed here.",
  "@system_surfacesCaption6": {
    "description": "lib/features/system/system_surfaces.dart:1351"
  },
  "system_surfacesCaption7": "Camera, notifications and biometrics are asked for only when needed.",
  "@system_surfacesCaption7": {
    "description": "lib/features/system/system_surfaces.dart:1446"
  },
  "system_surfacesCaption8": "Success, warning and error share one position and clear meaning.",
  "@system_surfacesCaption8": {
    "description": "lib/features/system/system_surfaces.dart:1552"
  },
  "system_surfacesCaption9": "Lists, details and charts each keep a stable layout so content doesn't jump.",
  "@system_surfacesCaption9": {
    "description": "lib/features/system/system_surfaces.dart:1623"
  },
